  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Do lượng thuốc trong cơ thể giảm dần theo thời gian nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> làm hàm nghịch biến từ đó suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Theo bài ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math> mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Sau 5 giờ, lượng thuốc trong cơ thể là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>768</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy sau 5 giờ lượng thuốc đã giảm đi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>768</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>67</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>232</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math> so với lượng thuốc ban đầu.</li></ol>",
